    {
      "id": "zZoCSx1iFN4kRX5WfQ6Cj",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1092.399601054747,
      "y": -8384.283551933971,
      "width": 1212.2391357421875,
      "height": 325,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "#b2f2bb",
      "fillStyle": "cross-hatch",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "bYJ",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 186275051,
      "version": 723,
      "versionNonce": 1548309323,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1786885066927,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "1. Charge dispute\n2. Dispute auto resolution - algorithem:\n    * Below certainty range\n    * Based on claim and hisotrical data\n    * clinet first > never auto reject\n\nDemo Flow:\n1. Starting from a pre-sent mock email containing a PDF invoice that describes a rent cost and an additional defect found, \nplus before-and-after images and an extra penalty cost (you can create the PDF, and I'll send it to myself), the email will \ninclude a link to the client dashboard. This defect will have a confidence of 60%.\n2. The client will click the link and open his dashboard; he will again see the rental details and the newly found defect. H\ne will have a button to start a dispute. This will create a new dispute in the “UVeye Dispute Resolution” dashboard.\n3. The opss will see the new dispute in “UVeye Dispute Resolution,” along with all the required information.",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "1. Charge dispute\n2. Dispute auto resolution - algorithem:\n    * Below certainty range\n    * Based on claim and hisotrical data\n    * clinet first > never auto reject\n\nDemo Flow:\n1. Starting from a pre-sent mock email containing a PDF invoice that describes a rent cost and an additional defect found, \nplus before-and-after images and an extra penalty cost (you can create the PDF, and I'll send it to myself), the email will \ninclude a link to the client dashboard. This defect will have a confidence of 60%.\n2. The client will click the link and open his dashboard; he will again see the rental details and the newly found defect. H\ne will have a button to start a dispute. This will create a new dispute in the “UVeye Dispute Resolution” dashboard.\n3. The opss will see the new dispute in “UVeye Dispute Resolution,” along with all the required information.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
